{"unit_id":"Khorsheed__dsh-basic#card-zh","repo":"Khorsheed/dsh-basic","commit":"9a73f85ca0f4b09f10ef24cc2b17cb8fe7d6cb14","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@khorsheed/dsh-basic 是一个 DSH 日常体验家族套件，通过 family bundle 补丁组合十二个成员插件，并以一个包统一安装。成员覆盖消息编辑与撤回、会话时间轴和标题修改、引用、文件浏览与产物预览、上下文压缩提醒、后台任务状态、技能工具目录、移动端界面及状态提示。它适合希望一次加入多种界面与会话辅助功能的 DSH 用户；各成员的具体实现由成员包提供，本仓库不注册自有服务或工具。安装命令为 dsh plugin --profile web add @khorsheed/dsh-basic；声明的最低宿主版本为 0.1.5-rc.1。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1-8","cordis.patch.yml:13-60","package.json:65-101"]}
{"unit_id":"Khorsheed__dsh-basic#card-en","repo":"Khorsheed/dsh-basic","commit":"9a73f85ca0f4b09f10ef24cc2b17cb8fe7d6cb14","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@khorsheed/dsh-basic is a DSH family bundle that installs twelve interface and session helper plugins together. Members cover message actions, session navigation, file previews, context reminders, background tasks, skill catalogs, and mobile access. The bundle declares no runtime tools of its own.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1-8","cordis.patch.yml:13-60","package.json:65-101"]}
